{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "真客服吗",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 63.28,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "交易所今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "交易所今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.562
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "查一查，客服后台有多少人，能查到一条完整的用户记录。",
   "spoken": "查一查，客服后台有多少人，能查到一条完整的用户记录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 3.98,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 4.074,
   "speechEnd": 8.525
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "普通用户也有几件事。",
   "spoken": "普通用户也有几件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 9.0,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 9.0,
   "speechEnd": 10.542
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "买硬件钱包用代收地址，交易所和电商用不同的邮箱。",
   "spoken": "买硬件钱包用代收地址，交易所和电商用不同的邮箱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 10.98,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 11.082,
   "speechEnd": 15.745
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "不在社交媒体上，把自己的地址或 ENS 名称，和真实身份连在一起。",
   "spoken": "不在社交媒体上，把自己的地址或 ENS 名称，和真实身份连在一起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 16.16,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 16.256,
   "speechEnd": 22.034
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "收到交易所的泄露通知，开启提币白名单，至少几个月保持警惕。",
   "spoken": "收到交易所的泄露通知，开启提币白名单，至少几个月保持警惕。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 22.46,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 22.46,
   "speechEnd": 27.825
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "回到开头的题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 28.28,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 28.28,
   "speechEnd": 29.382
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "对方说得出你的名字、余额和工单，不代表他是真客服。",
   "spoken": "对方说得出你的名字、余额和工单，不代表他是真客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 29.78,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 29.78,
   "speechEnd": 34.706
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "这些数据，可能早就泄露了。",
   "spoken": "这些数据，可能早就泄露了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 35.12,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 35.12,
   "speechEnd": 37.335
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "交易所和钱包厂商，永远不会让你把资产转到安全地址，也不会索要助记词。",
   "spoken": "交易所和钱包厂商，永远不会让你把资产转到安全地址，也不会索要助记词。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 37.74,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 37.74,
   "speechEnd": 44.478
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "主动打来的电话、短信、邮件，说你的账户有风险，一律挂断，再从官方 App 里联系客服。",
   "spoken": "主动打来的电话、短信、邮件，说你的账户有风险，一律挂断，再从官方 App 里联系客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 44.92,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 45.015,
   "speechEnd": 53.053
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "数据里没有密码，可它告诉骗子，该骗谁，该怎么说。",
   "spoken": "数据里没有密码，可它告诉骗子，该骗谁，该怎么说。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 53.46,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 53.46,
   "speechEnd": 58.327
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "下一集讲资金追踪与事后处置。",
   "spoken": "下一集讲资金追踪与事后处置。",
